  "scope": "11 explicit original socket/UDP/IPC/cluster suites, two runs. Thirteen native controls include bidirectional IPC plus connected UDP adoption via inherited fd/Bun API, node:dgram fd, and IPC; disconnect/reconnect and cached-address/port close transitions; descriptor zero and a changing TCP fd getter read once. Baselines and failed fixture attempts are retained. Poll-failure cleanup removes partial registrations before freeing native poll data. Original skips receive no passing credit. Windows handle transport, cluster connection tracking, malformed/closed handles, asynchronous receive adoption failure ownership, GC/stress, complete native/registry ownership, whole-suite, Release/ASAN and other-platform parity remain incomplete.",
